yuma123-netconfd-module-hs-sensor-shield (1.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * New hs-sensor-shield netconfd module implementing ietf-hardware-state
    (RFC 8348) for the Heimonen Solutions sensor shield: PMS7003
    (pm1/pm25/pm10), SCD41 (co2), SGP41 (voc-index/nox-index, Sensirion gas
    index algorithm), SHT41 (temperature/humidity), LPS22HB (pressure) and
    BH1750 (illuminance) as ianahw:sensor components
  * SCD41 built-in temperature/humidity used automatically when no SHT41
  * No sensor values are served during the first 60 s after start
  * SCD41 temperature/humidity not reported nor used for SGP41 compensation
    for 5 min after a (re)start of periodic measurement (readings are ~2 C
    high while its self heating compensation settles); SCD41 bus errors
    and restarts are logged, restarts only after 10 s errors / 30 s idle
  * Daily quiet window (default 00:00-01:00, HS_SENSOR_SHIELD_QUIET_WINDOW)
    during which temperature, humidity, voc-index and nox-index are not
    reported, for the midnight maintenance jobs that heat up the board
  * Sensors are sampled continuously by background threads, <get> returns
    the latest readings with per sensor oper-status and value-timestamp
  * Replaces the ietf-hardware-state-2 STS3x/PMS7003 module

 -- Joar Heimonen <spam@joar.me>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 12:00:00 +0200

