yuma123-netconfd-module-ietf-hardware-state-raspberry-pi (1.0) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * Replaced lsi-thermometers with ietf-hardware-state (RFC 8348) module
  * Temperature from Sensirion STS3x on I2C reported as component 'temperature'
  * Added Plantower PMS7003 particulate matter sensor on UART (GPIO 15 / /dev/serial0)
    reported as components 'pm1', 'pm25' and 'pm10'

